{"seq":4,"slug":"artifact-management","title":"制品管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/artifact-management","wordCount":999,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"制品管理\">制品管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>制品（Artifact）是 CI/CD 流水线中构建阶段的产出物——编译后的二进制文件、Docker 镜像、npm 包、静态资源包等。制品管理解决的核心问题是：<strong>如何确保部署到生产环境的代码与通过测试的代码完全一致</strong>。这个问题看似简单，实际上涉及版本控制、不可变性、完整性校验和生命周期管理等多个维度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B[CI 构建]&#10;    B --&gt; C[制品注册表]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Staging 部署]&#10;    D --&gt; E[验收测试]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Production 部署]&#10;    C --&gt; G[版本标签]&#10;    C --&gt; H[元数据]&#10;    C --&gt; I[完整性校验]&#10;    subgraph 制品生命周期&#10;        C&#10;        G&#10;        H&#10;        I&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B[CI 构建]\n    B --&gt; C[制品注册表]\n    C --&gt; D[Staging 部署]\n    D --&gt; E[验收测试]\n    E --&gt; F[Production 部署]\n    C --&gt; G[版本标签]\n    C --&gt; H[元数据]\n    C --&gt; I[完整性校验]\n    subgraph 制品生命周期\n        C\n        G\n        H\n        I\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>制品类型</th>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>版本策略</th>\n<th>保留策略</th>\n<th>典型大小</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Docker 镜像</td>\n<td>Container Registry</td>\n<td>标签 + SHA</td>\n<td>Tag 永久，SHA 30天</td>\n<td>50-500MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>npm 包</td>\n<td>npm Registry</td>\n<td>SemVer</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>1-50MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态资源包</td>\n<td>S3/OSS</td>\n<td>Git SHA</td>\n<td>90天</td>\n<td>5-50MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二进制文件</td>\n<td>Release Assets</td>\n<td>SemVer</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>10-200MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Helm Chart</td>\n<td>Chart Registry</td>\n<td>SemVer</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>10-100KB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"不可变制品原则\">不可变制品原则</h2><p>制品管理的第一原则是<strong>不可变性（Immutability）</strong>：一旦制品被发布到注册表，就不能被修改或覆盖。这个原则保证了可追溯性和可重复性——任何时候拉取同一个版本号的制品，得到的内容都完全相同。</p>\n<p>违反不可变性的常见反模式是<strong>可变标签</strong>。例如 Docker 的 <code>latest</code> 标签会随每次推送而变化，<code>main</code> 分支标签也是如此。这导致&quot;昨天能用今天不能用&quot;的幽灵问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ArtifactVersion {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  version: string;&#10;  digest: string;&#10;  immutable: boolean;&#10;  createdAt: Date;&#10;  buildRef: string;&#10;  sourceCommit: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const versioningStrategy = {&#10;  release: {&#10;    pattern: &#39;v{major}.{minor}.{patch}&#39;,&#10;    immutable: true,&#10;    retention: &#39;forever&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  prerelease: {&#10;    pattern: &#39;v{major}.{minor}.{patch}-rc.{n}&#39;,&#10;    immutable: true,&#10;    retention: &#39;90d&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  snapshot: {&#10;    pattern: &#39;{branch}-{sha7}-{timestamp}&#39;,&#10;    immutable: true,&#10;    retention: &#39;30d&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  mutable: {&#10;    pattern: &#39;latest&#39;,&#10;    immutable: false,&#10;    retention: &#39;overwritten&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArtifactVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  digest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  immutable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  buildRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sourceCommit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> versioningStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  release: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pattern: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'v{major}.{minor}.{patch}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    immutable: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'forever'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prerelease: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pattern: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'v{major}.{minor}.{patch}-rc.{n}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    immutable: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pattern: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{branch}-{sha7}-{timestamp}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    immutable: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mutable: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pattern: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'latest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    immutable: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'overwritten'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确的做法是使用<strong>内容寻址</strong>或<strong>Git SHA</strong>作为制品的唯一标识，然后用人类可读的标签（如 <code>v1.2.3</code>）作为别名指向它。Docker 中这就是 <code>digest</code>（<code>sha256:abc...</code>）和 <code>tag</code> 的关系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Build and push image&#10;  run: |&#10;    DIGEST=$(docker build --push -t $REGISTRY/$IMAGE:$SHA . | grep digest | awk &#39;{print $NF}&#39;)&#10;    echo &quot;digest=$DIGEST&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT&#10;&#10;- name: Tag release&#10;  if: startsWith(github.ref, &#39;refs/tags/v&#39;)&#10;  run: |&#10;    crane tag $REGISTRY/$IMAGE@$DIGEST ${{ github.ref_name }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build and push image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    DIGEST=$(docker build --push -t $REGISTRY/$IMAGE:$SHA . | grep digest | awk '{print $NF}')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    echo \"digest=$DIGEST\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Tag release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">startsWith(github.ref, 'refs/tags/v')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    crane tag $REGISTRY/$IMAGE@$DIGEST ${{ github.ref_name }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"语义化版本管理\">语义化版本管理</h2><p>对于发布型制品（npm 包、Helm Chart、公共 API），语义化版本（SemVer）是行业标准。SemVer 通过版本号传达变更的性质：<code>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[提交历史分析] --&gt; B{变更类型}&#10;    B --&gt;|BREAKING CHANGE| C[Major + 1]&#10;    B --&gt;|feat:| D[Minor + 1]&#10;    B --&gt;|fix:| E[Patch + 1]&#10;    C --&gt; F[发布 v2.0.0]&#10;    D --&gt; G[发布 v1.1.0]&#10;    E --&gt; H[发布 v1.0.1]&#10;    F --&gt; I[更新 Changelog]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[提交历史分析] --&gt; B{变更类型}\n    B --&gt;|BREAKING CHANGE| C[Major + 1]\n    B --&gt;|feat:| D[Minor + 1]\n    B --&gt;|fix:| E[Patch + 1]\n    C --&gt; F[发布 v2.0.0]\n    D --&gt; G[发布 v1.1.0]\n    E --&gt; H[发布 v1.0.1]\n    F --&gt; I[更新 Changelog]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>自动化语义化版本的工具链基于<strong>约定式提交（Conventional Commits）</strong>。<code>semantic-release</code> 或 <code>changesets</code> 分析提交历史，自动决定版本号递增方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ConventionalCommit {&#10;  type: &#39;feat&#39; | &#39;fix&#39; | &#39;docs&#39; | &#39;chore&#39; | &#39;refactor&#39; | &#39;perf&#39; | &#39;test&#39;;&#10;  scope?: string;&#10;  breaking: boolean;&#10;  description: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const versionBump = (commits: ConventionalCommit[]): &#39;major&#39; | &#39;minor&#39; | &#39;patch&#39; =&gt; {&#10;  if (commits.some((c) =&gt; c.breaking)) return &#39;major&#39;;&#10;  if (commits.some((c) =&gt; c.type === &#39;feat&#39;)) return &#39;minor&#39;;&#10;  return &#39;patch&#39;;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConventionalCommit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'feat'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fix'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'docs'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'chore'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'refactor'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'perf'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  breaking</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> versionBump</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">commits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConventionalCommit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'major'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'minor'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'patch'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (commits.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.breaking)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'major'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (commits.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'feat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'minor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'patch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Monorepo 中，<code>changesets</code> 工作流更为灵活。开发者在 PR 中添加 changeset 文件声明变更的包和级别，CI 自动汇总并生成版本 PR：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Create Release&#10;  uses: changesets/action@v1&#10;  with:&#10;    publish: pnpm changeset publish&#10;    version: pnpm changeset version&#10;  env:&#10;    GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;    NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Create Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">changesets/action@v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    NPM_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"制品安全与完整性\">制品安全与完整性</h2><p>制品的安全性关乎供应链安全。从构建到部署的每个环节都可能被篡改——CI 环境被入侵、传输过程被中间人攻击、注册表被入侵等。</p>\n<p><strong>签名与验证</strong>是防篡改的核心手段。Sigstore 的 <code>cosign</code> 工具为 Docker 镜像提供无密钥签名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cosign sign --yes $REGISTRY/$IMAGE@$DIGEST&#10;&#10;cosign verify \\&#10;  --certificate-identity &quot;https://github.com/org/repo/.github/workflows/build.yml@refs/heads/main&quot; \\&#10;  --certificate-oidc-issuer &quot;https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com&quot; \\&#10;  $REGISTRY/$IMAGE@$DIGEST\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cosign</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --yes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $REGISTRY</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$IMAGE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$DIGEST</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cosign</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> verify</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --certificate-identity</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://github.com/org/repo/.github/workflows/build.yml@refs/heads/main\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --certificate-oidc-issuer</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  $REGISTRY</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$IMAGE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$DIGEST</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>SBOM（软件物料清单）</strong> 记录制品包含的所有依赖及其版本。当新漏洞被披露时，SBOM 让你快速判断哪些制品受影响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SBOMEntry {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  version: string;&#10;  license: string;&#10;  purl: string;&#10;  vulnerabilities: Vulnerability[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ArtifactSecurity {&#10;  artifact: ArtifactVersion;&#10;  signature: string;&#10;  sbom: SBOMEntry[];&#10;  attestations: Attestation[];&#10;  scanResults: ScanResult;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SBOMEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  license</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  purl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  vulnerabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vulnerability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArtifactSecurity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  artifact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArtifactVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  signature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sbom</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SBOMEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  attestations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Attestation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scanResults</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ScanResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>SLSA（Supply-chain Levels for Software Artifacts）</strong> 框架定义了四个供应链安全等级，从基本的构建来源记录（Level 1）到全面的硬件隔离构建（Level 4）。GitHub Actions 和 Google Cloud Build 已支持生成 SLSA 证明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"制品生命周期管理\">制品生命周期管理</h2><p>制品如果不清理，注册表存储会无限增长。合理的保留策略需要在<strong>存储成本</strong>、<strong>可审计性</strong>和<strong>灾难恢复</strong>之间取得平衡。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RetentionPolicy {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  selector: (artifact: ArtifactVersion) =&gt; boolean;&#10;  retention: string;&#10;  action: &#39;delete&#39; | &#39;archive&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const policies: RetentionPolicy[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;keep-releases-forever&#39;,&#10;    selector: (a) =&gt; /^v\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+$/.test(a.version),&#10;    retention: &#39;forever&#39;,&#10;    action: &#39;archive&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;prune-snapshots-30d&#39;,&#10;    selector: (a) =&gt; a.version.includes(&#39;-snapshot&#39;),&#10;    retention: &#39;30d&#39;,&#10;    action: &#39;delete&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;prune-pr-builds-7d&#39;,&#10;    selector: (a) =&gt; a.version.startsWith(&#39;pr-&#39;),&#10;    retention: &#39;7d&#39;,&#10;    action: &#39;delete&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;keep-rc-90d&#39;,&#10;    selector: (a) =&gt; a.version.includes(&#39;-rc.&#39;),&#10;    retention: &#39;90d&#39;,&#10;    action: &#39;delete&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetentionPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">artifact</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArtifactVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retention</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delete'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'archive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> policies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetentionPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'keep-releases-forever'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a.version),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'forever'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'archive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prune-snapshots-30d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.version.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-snapshot'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'delete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prune-pr-builds-7d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.version.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pr-'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'delete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'keep-rc-90d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.version.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-rc.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    retention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'delete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自动清理通常通过定时任务（CronJob 或 Scheduled Workflow）执行。在清理前，需要确保没有活跃部署正在使用即将被删除的制品——这通常通过查询 Kubernetes 集群中正在运行的镜像 digest 来实现。</p>\n<p>保留策略还需要考虑<strong>合规要求</strong>。金融和医疗行业通常要求保留所有发布制品 3-7 年，这时需要将冷数据归档到低成本存储（如 S3 Glacier）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>制品管理确保&quot;测试通过的代码&quot;与&quot;部署的代码&quot;完全一致</li>\n<li>不可变性是制品管理的第一原则——用内容寻址 + 标签别名替代可变标签</li>\n<li>语义化版本 + 约定式提交实现自动化版本管理和变更日志生成</li>\n<li>供应链安全需要签名验证（cosign）、SBOM 和 SLSA 证明多层防护</li>\n<li>保留策略按制品类型差异化——Release 永久，Snapshot 30 天，PR 7 天</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"制品管理","id":"制品管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不可变制品原则","id":"不可变制品原则"},{"level":2,"text":"语义化版本管理","id":"语义化版本管理"},{"level":2,"text":"制品安全与完整性","id":"制品安全与完整性"},{"level":2,"text":"制品生命周期管理","id":"制品生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"构建自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/build-automation"},"next":{"title":"GitHub Actions 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions/actions-fundamentals"}}